<title>SOUTH KOREA: Seoul to close bourse on Nov 23 for system change.</title>
<headline>Seoul to close bourse on Nov 23 for system change.</headline>
<dateline>SEOUL 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Korea Stock Exchange said on Wednesday it would close the local stock market on November 23 to upgrade its main computer systems.</p>
<p>An exchange official said the one-day closure was inevitable because the upgrading requires to suspend system operation for at least 60 hours.</p>
<p>-- Seoul Newsroom (822) 727-5646</p>
</text>
